		<title>Malicious Domain in SolarWinds Hack Turned into ‘Killswitch’</title>
		<link>https://krebsonsecurity.com/2020/12/malicious-domain-in-solarwinds-hack-turned-into-killswitch/</link>
					<comments>https://krebsonsecurity.com/2020/12/malicious-domain-in-solarwinds-hack-turned-into-killswitch/#comments</comments>
		
